4. Contributions
----------------

By submitting a contribution to this repository, including through a Pull
Request, the contributor represents that they have the right to submit the
contribution and agrees that their original contribution may be distributed
under the license applicable to the part of the project being modified:

- original knowledge, documentation, Markdown, and similar explanatory content
