- original software code and code-like files under the MIT License.

A contribution must not contain third-party material that the contributor does
not have the right to submit under the applicable terms.

Submitting a contribution does not guarantee its incorporation into the
project. Contributions are governed by `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and the
repository review process. Only contributions reviewed and approved by the
maintainer may be incorporated into `main`.

5. Practical Interpretation
---------------------------

In practical terms:

- you may freely reuse original knowledge and documentation created for this
